# FCNX-Ensembling

Mean-field / VGA research on 2-layer erf nets (FCN2) learning a cubic Hermite teacher, not an application codebase. Prefer reading the files below over a full-repo crawl.

## Layout

- `julia_lib/` — theory: `FCS2_VGA.jl` (bimodal VGA), `fcn2_vga_erf.jl` (CLI, `--offdiag`), `FCS2Erf_Cubic.jl` (classical Laplace)
- `milestones/fcn2_erf_hidden_kernel/` — training (`train_fcn2_erf_sigma_a.py`, `train_fcn2_erf.py`), red-robin launchers, W0/A analysis (`plot_action_h0_activation.py`)
- `journal/` — Langevin cubic notebooks and d-dimensional sweeps

## This machine (`zohar-gpu-2`)

Self-hosted Cursor worker. nvidia-smi GPU0 = RTX 4080 (often idle); GPU1 = RTX 4090. PyTorch `cuda:0` is the **4090**. Do not start competing GPU jobs or kill `steepwell_invariant` / `train_fcn2_erf*` unless asked.

Check live runs: `tmux ls`, then `tmux capture-pane -t steepwell_invariant -p -S -80`.

